    <summary>Intelligent Persian and bilingual typing assistant for Windows with zero telemetry</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Ravaan (روان) is an intelligent, privacy-first Persian/English typing assistant for Windows.

Features:
- Offline local text prediction and autocompletion
- Real-time typo correction and wrong keyboard layout detection
- Persian typography and ZWNJ (نیم‌فاصله) normalization
- Finglish phonetic conversion
- Snippet expansion and inline calculator
- Zero telemetry, zero keystroke logging, open source
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/mohsen-niksirat/Ravaan/releases/tag/v2.4.0</releaseNotes>
